# --- 凭证与明文密钥（绝不入库；统一走全局 secrets） ---
.secrets/*.json
.secrets/*.txt
.secrets/*.raw
.secrets/*.key
.secrets/*.pem
*.pem
*.key
.env
.env.*
!*.enc

